  "definitions": {
    "coverage": "Export overlap_coverage and promotion_service_coverage use ALL successful foreground anchor demand D. Useful fraction uses ALL returned payload anchor P. Not renamed a node hit rate.",
    "node_counts": "Reported NodeAnchor/RootAnchor kinds, with returned-node type evidence supplementing demanded ID type. Generic unprefetched Anchor would remain unclassified and can undercount node-only D. This source limitation is disclosed separately from the observed kinds below.",
    "service": "Actual nonplanning FG promote_raw success of same Session/UID, inside a successful demand-call interval and after non-discarded return. Witness raw line/record hashes validated; not exact insertion readiness or saved latency.",
    "unused": "P minus observed successful demand; node-unused is an observational lower bound. Neither implies semantic not-needed/filter-only white read. Predicate/ownership/id accesses are valid demand.",
    "precision_regime": "One separate instrumented capture per57cells, not primary n5 or timing sample."
  },
  "conclusion": "Node-only denominator has classification limitations; use explicitly ALL-anchor rates and publish generic/other kind counts."
